# {{name}}

The `extalia-daemon` binary of [Extalia](https://github.com/Extalia-VO/extalia-virtual-agent)
for **{{platform}}-{{arch}}** (`{{triple}}`), version {{version}}.

Do not install this package directly. The `extalia-vo` CLI lists it as an optional
dependency; npm installs only the package whose `os` and `cpu` match the machine, so the
CLI runs without a Rust toolchain.

```js
const daemonPath = require('{{name}}'); // absolute path of bin/{{binary}}
```

Built in CI from the tagged source (`crates/extalia-daemon`) and released in lockstep with
`extalia-vo`. MIT licensed.
